This folder (shell/assets/skills/graphify in LlmOnLan) ships SKILL.md, adapted by LlmOnLan
from graphify v0.9.71 (https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify, tag v0.9.71, commit
d6eaa8aae8df155874ebb1044302c055c286342a): its extraction spec
(graphify/skills/claude/references/extraction-spec.md, and the compact form in
tools/skillgen/fragments/references/shared/extraction-spec-compact.md), the graph.json layout
written by graphify/export.py (to_json) and the report sections of graphify/report.py. It was
rewritten for a model that has only file tools (no Python, no shell, no subagents, no web).
